en you interact with the Sabbat, you can count with an Influence rating that\u2019s equal to your Sabbat Survivor lore rating minus one. </span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">\u26ab\u26ab\u26ab\u26ab Blood Brethren </span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">You secretly maintain ties to the Sabbat, perhaps through old pack members or mentors that you once shared Vinculi with, perhaps through more recent acquaintances. These individuals still remain in your area, hidden away or ensconced in isolated Sabbat strongholds, and may aid you in any number of ways. You have five dots of Mawla representing your Sabbat allies. </span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">\u26ab\u26ab\u26ab\u26ab\u26ab The Black Hand </span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">You might be an undercover agent for the Sabbat, or just embroiled in some unfathomable agenda beyond your control, and are a person of interest for the Black Hand, the secretive sub-sect that serves as the elite military of the Sabbat, The shadowy, ancient leaders of the Black Hand, the Seraphim, watches you from afar, and the Hand may come to your aid in the most dire of circumstances. You can call upon the Black Hand for a major boon once per story, but their involvement tends to make things escalate <i>very</i> quickly. </span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks. I'm going to pinch this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}